# Smart Dimension on a segment: L1, then its label above it, the length
# typed at once, while the editor's measured value is still selected (d1).
# Then L2, M four times to its angle from the x axis, and the angle typed in
# degrees (a1).
open tests/data/sketch-dimension.json
wait 16
action tool.dimension
wait 2
click L 360 248
click L 396 211
text "0.8"
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 716 476
action tool.method
action tool.method
action tool.method
action tool.method
wait 2
click L 652 430
wait 2
text "30"
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
